{"ID":"20240522082234-evwu185","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082234-evwu185","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082234-evwu185\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522103015-eptwwf5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522103721-p89p0oz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522103721-p89p0oz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"盲腸炎(闌尾炎)","type":"doc","updated":"20240522103721"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522103015-eptwwf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-eptwwf5","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"盲腸炎(闌尾炎)"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-52ie1gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-52ie1gm","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"林女士 51歲  初診日期:94/06/08"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-la2xxw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-la2xxw8","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：下腹痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-7j8zj1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-7j8zj1t","updated":"20240522103024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(94.06.06星期一因下腹痛送至醫院急診，醫院檢查時找不到病因，在急診室住了一晚，腹部較不痛故星期二出院回家，今日又大痛起來、趕忙至我診所就診。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-o51g7ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-o51g7ue","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌紅苔薄黃"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-d4gvuaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-d4gvuaz","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下腹痛，大便一日一次、大便稍硬、小便黃，小便灼熱、小便刺痛、小腹空墜感。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-17oakwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-17oakwc","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"觸診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按右少腹痛且有反彈痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-ex6q9cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-ex6q9cx","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右關尺之間有一點浮結在那裡不動"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-t67deww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-t67deww","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腸癰"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-dofayrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-dofayrb","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩小腿闌尾穴、足三里、水道、陰陵泉"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-hjtzmjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-hjtzmjc","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大黃牡丹皮湯2克、荊防敗毒散2克、薏苡仁3克、炮附子1.3克、敗醬草4克、白茅根1.5克、鳳尾草 1.5克、蘆根1克、石膏2克 4X3"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-a7w9j4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-a7w9j4r","updated":"20240522103027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(在針灸期間突然發燒至38.1度，故上面處方乃更動過後之處方，並告知患者乃盲腸炎。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-ni7a67m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-ni7a67m","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"林女士 51歲 二診日期:94/06/11"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-2qiza7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-2qiza7t","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：下腹痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-lxcdtzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-lxcdtzr","updated":"20240522103516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(上次針灸完後腹痛減少，服藥時第ㄧ包沒拉肚子，此後每包皆腹瀉，第二包腹瀉後燒退了！問她爲何沒有打電話問我，每包皆拉肚子怎麼辦？她說因為越拉越舒服，以為本來就是要腹瀉才有效，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我心想下次可不能再下如此猛藥，要想辦法避免此情況。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":")"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-feyn67k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-feyn67k","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌紅苔薄黃"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-md1j34p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-md1j34p","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下腹稍痛，大便一日4次、大便溏、小便黃，小便熱、小便痛減。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-iu94fn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-iu94fn6","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"觸診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按右少腹稍痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-zl0e1zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-zl0e1zn","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右關尺之間有一點浮結在那裡不動有缩小"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-fxxm3r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-fxxm3r7","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腸癰"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-8pkfsih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-8pkfsih","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 參苓白朮散4克、薏苡仁3克、炮附子1.3克、敗醬草4克、車前子1克、鳳尾草 1.5克、瞿麥1克 4X3"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-f85stay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-f85stay","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"林女士 51歲 三診日期:94/06/13"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-3jbgwis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-3jbgwis","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：下腹痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-8c20g2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-8c20g2x","updated":"20240522103033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(好很多、已不太痛，此次拿藥要求久ㄧ點，因怕復發。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-4ok8rhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-4ok8rhg","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌淡紅苔白"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-7p07qsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-7p07qsx","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下腹已不痛，大便一日ㄧ次、大便軟、小便稍黃。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-w6hqwr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-w6hqwr4","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"觸診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按右少腹不痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-4x1wl2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-4x1wl2r","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右關尺之間有一點浮結已摸不太清楚"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-7766kux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-7766kux","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腸癰"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-gm1s4bj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-gm1s4bj","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 參苓白朮散3克、薏苡仁3克、炮附子1克、敗醬草3克、車前子1克、鳳尾草 1克、瞿麥1克 3X6"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-2aq4uxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-2aq4uxf","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l           "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"楊小姐 47歲  初診日期:97/07/05"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-q0lx0o8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-q0lx0o8","updated":"20240522103039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹部脹悶不舒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-sqd7xha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-sqd7xha","updated":"20240522103040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(由我的整脊老師介紹來就診，自訴因96.11月至台大開刀拿掉子宮肌瘤，97.04月開始腹部脹悶不舒至今。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-1byxefl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-1byxefl","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌淡紅苔薄白"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-qzu6fo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-qzu6fo2","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃部及腹部脹悶不舒，大便一日一次、大便軟、小便黃。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-hyyt4rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-hyyt4rr","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"觸診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按左少腹疼痛但沒有反彈痛、按壓左耳穴大腸點疼痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-6h94g0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-6h94g0s","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右關尺之間有一點浮結在那裡不動"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-68grevr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-68grevr","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腸癰"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-ivkcwmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-ivkcwmm","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方一："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"薏苡仁2.5克、炮附子1.5克、敗醬草5克、白芨1克、牡丹皮 1、冬瓜子1克、桃仁1克  3X6"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-d4bqk5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-d4bqk5o","updated":"20240522103524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方二："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黃牡丹皮湯1.5克、白芨1克  3X2  ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"若一天內皆沒有解便則需服用一包、若有解便則不用服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-kmtgvaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-kmtgvaz","updated":"20240522103042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(把脈後知其為慢性大腸發炎，按壓腹部後找到左少腹痛，問她為何沒說左少腹痛？她回答因小時候有左邊疝氣，所以常左少腹痛，以為是自己體力虛又引發疝氣故沒告知，且已安排下星期要至台大醫院檢查是否又疝氣復發？且左少腹有時痛、有時又不痛已三個多月，跟之前疝氣很像，我告訴她不必去做檢查了，是大腸發炎反正去醫院也查不出來！交代她服完藥後要再來。97.10.02楊小姐又因它病求診，問她為何前次沒復診？她說去台大醫院檢查只查出腸內有氣體，並沒有疝氣或其他疾病，吃中藥完後就沒有腹部脹悶不舒及左少腹痛，因有事至南美洲二個多月，回台後因感冒故再次就診 )"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-i18yx9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-i18yx9l","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"結語"}]},{"ID":"20240522103047-jappxzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103047-jappxzw","updated":"20240522103532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在中國醫藥學院附設醫院急診室實習時，是ㄧ天上十二小時班、早上交班時按慣例要再檢查病人一次，有ㄧ次我上早班因為住院醫師忙著和另一位住院醫師口頭交班，要我獨自先去檢查病人，等查完後住院醫師告知我主治醫師要把其中ㄧ位女病人辦出院，因為觀察了ㄧ個晚上沒怎麼樣？我馬上跟住院醫師說那女的好像是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"闌尾炎(俗稱盲腸炎)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，他急忙帶著我再去檢查那位女病人果然是闌尾炎，便急忙送去開刀了！也許大家會覺得奇怪，為何有如此大的轉變？其實昨夜急診時那老婦人說是胃痛，而一些緊急需處理的狀況並沒出現，例如說嘔吐的很厲害甚至吐血或解黑便，反而在急診室吊點滴後，吃些胃藥就慢慢不痛了！在早上我查看病歷時寫疑似胃炎，問她胃部如何？回答不痛了！再問有哪裡不舒服嗎？告知右下腹痛，我按她右下腹痛且有反彈痛便知是闌尾炎，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以有些病在初發作時是以他處顯現，最後才在本位發作。而且若是開刀下去、大概有七成機率真的是闌尾炎，而三成不是便被歸類為誤診，但反正已經開刀了、就順便把闌尾拿掉！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"當然這是早期的統計，現在有沒有更精確、我就不曉得了！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-nkfkz1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-nkfkz1v","updated":"20240522103145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在行醫時、有一次碰到一位軍中服役的男病人，因為腹痛、腹瀉好幾次、被他父親帶來求診，想說很簡單、開立科中服用就好！過ㄧ陣子他父親就診時，我問及他兒子近況，告知因第二天人仍很不舒服，至軍醫院急診、診斷為闌尾炎後開刀住院、現出院回部隊了！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"啊！ㄧ聽真是無地自容，因為不細心我把病人誤診了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因為教科書上及西醫老師上課所教，並沒有說盲腸炎會腹瀉，所以一直以為闌尾炎會便秘，而在實習時看到的皆是大便不順的患者，此種先入為主的觀念才導致判斷錯誤，可見例外還是有的、為醫者要小心辨症。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-ta4a0mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-ta4a0mq","updated":"20240522103555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在90年左右有一小學二年級的小女孩因胃痛想吐來就診，把脈之後告知其母親是盲腸炎，若服藥沒效需至醫院檢查"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(因對科中信心不夠，想可能需水藥才有效，可是在後來的行醫過程中，用藥粉治療闌尾炎就有效。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"約二個月後小女孩因感冒來看病，問她媽上次服藥後情形、她媽說很後悔！問她為何如此說？告訴我小女孩吃藥後胃痛較好，三天藥服完就沒痛，沒想到隔兩天胃又痛，帶到醫院小兒科求診剛好碰到的女主任是我中醫系同學，問明病史檢查完後告訴她，只是一般胃腸脹氣開個藥服用就好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(想是我同學認為中醫怎麼可能單用望聞問切就知闌尾炎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"後來服用小兒科藥有比較緩和，到星期六晚上突然大痛起來，其母忙送到醫院急診室"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(本想找我、但因我星期六晚上休診去學氣功)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"值班醫師一看病歷既然小兒科主任如此診斷，檢查完後當然又留小女孩在急診室觀察，可是她母親越看小女孩的症狀、越覺不對勁，於是打電話給一位認識的護理長，把情況和她說、那位護理長建議轉至她服務的醫院，轉院後ㄧ抽血檢查白血球ㄧ萬多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(是否有做其它檢查、其母並沒詳細告訴我)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就進開刀房手術割掉闌尾、術後就不痛了，小女孩母親說很後悔的原因是，若沒聽兒科主任的話、再找我治療也許不用挨那一刀，後來我治療經驗多了，很肯定那刀真是不用挨的！但若托延至腹膜炎中醫雖有藥，但並不是每家診所都有備藥(因為案例太少、像我就沒備藥、因為這種病人大多已送進醫院。)，真的就非手術不可了！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103103-umxxnbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103103-umxxnbm","updated":"20240522103610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最近很多案例因打完新流感疫苗而發生問題，在新聞媒體報導"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"台中一名7歲男童這起病例，劉小弟上個月19日接種H1N1疫苗，隔天雙腳就出現紅疹症狀，5天後高燒不退、全身起紅疹，當時醫師說病症傾向幼年型類風濕性關節炎，家人花了30幾萬接受免疫球蛋白治療，沒有效果，轉往台大醫院治療，但沒過多久，小男童併發腦幹出血，21日清晨過世，劉小弟的爸爸是台中知名醫院婦科主任"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；我特別提出此案例是因其父是西醫師，也許大家認為醫師應該最了解疫苗，一定認為安全才去打，其實恐怕不是這樣的，因為所讀的西醫書中並沒有被教導疫苗是如何被製造出來的？就是連藥學系的學生所讀的亦是同樣，除非自己有興趣去查疫苗的製造流程、才有辦法知道，不然就是參考新聞媒體所發表的，因為那是藥廠的製造方法，實際在生產線上才會想去了解。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-eb6we9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-eb6we9o","updated":"20240522103238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我想大家看到別人的不幸都感同身受，我也覺得悲哀沮喪、因為之前所寫的新流感(H1N1)發表後，仍然發生那麼多的不幸而且倪師也ㄧ再在網站上呼籲，這些似乎都沒有發揮預期的效果，代表有此常識的人其實不多，所以希望看到倪師網站的人，能夠把對疫苗的正確認知，轉寄給你的親朋好友，讓大眾知道而知所抉擇，避免悲劇ㄧ再重演、在此先謝謝您。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-12o4pog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-12o4pog","updated":"20240522103244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"癌症不是病(它是一種身體的求生機制 )"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-oydmosx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-oydmosx","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此書作者是安德烈‧莫瑞茲(Andreas Moritz)  皮海蒂 譯  原水文化出版"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-nm8719r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-nm8719r","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以下是一位讀者在讀完本書後的心得，因文章很長只摘錄心得其中幾點，請那位發表者見諒，感恩您！"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-nrx7cem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-nrx7cem","updated":"20240522103246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最近，看了一本書，叫做「癌症不是病」，這本書是國外的醫師寫的，顛覆了許多原來一般人的觀念，而且這些觀念是老早醫學界就已經知道的事實，可是卻沒有人願意告訴我們，癌症不是真正的疾病來源，因為每個成年人，每天都會有300億個細胞死亡，而其中有1％到10％，是癌細胞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-3st2jq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-3st2jq4","updated":"20240522103628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是說："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題1，我們都有癌症嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答案：是的。它也是身體的運作之一。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-6iq9r23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-6iq9r23","updated":"20240522103630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題2，癌細胞是我們自己自動產生的嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答案：是的，每個成年人，每天都會產生幾百萬個癌細胞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-avq80ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-avq80ur","updated":"20240522103258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因此有癌細胞，您並不需要恐慌，恐慌是一件很不明智的事情，只會讓您增加心情的壓力，讓毒素更多更多，身體便要產生更多的癌細"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-ndvyol7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-ndvyol7","updated":"20240522103259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胞來處理毒素。癌細胞的生長和滅亡，就像是您一般的細胞的生長和滅亡一樣，都是身體的自然運作的情形。上空的雲朵飄來又飄走，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-9yq7e7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-9yq7e7p","updated":"20240522103300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那麼的自然，您需要恐慌什麼？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-6781o50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-6781o50","updated":"20240522103632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題3，如果是這樣，癌細胞如何產生？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答案：身體總是難免有某些地方阻塞，氧氣輸送就會有問題，也會產生有害身體的物質(此和中醫不通則痛的理論完全相同)，細胞便基因突變改造，不再需要氧氣，變成癌細胞，將這些毒素吃掉分解，它改吃毒素，身體就是這樣運作。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-b2y4xpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-b2y4xpe","updated":"20240522103640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題4，那為什麼它會愈來愈大？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答案：當身體的阻塞一直無法克服，許多地方的毒素會一直累積增加，超過負荷，這樣正常的細胞就會一直轉換來變成癌細胞，以因應這樣的情況。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＊ 所以心情好與不好，就會造成毒素的累積！請放輕鬆～笑一個吧～＊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-5okd6mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-5okd6mn","updated":"20240522103643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題5，那癌細胞甚麼時候會死亡？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答案：癌細胞和正常細胞一樣會死亡，癌細胞會被T殺手細胞處理掉，完成它的任務，最後分解而死亡，但如果身體的毒素過多，癌細胞的數量便會變多。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＊所以不要弄錯了，請不要期待癌細胞死亡，如果您身體的毒素很多的話，您需要癌細胞來協助您！＊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-f2pm0jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-f2pm0jw","updated":"20240522103646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題6，如果身體是酸性，那會怎樣？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：中文常說：「酸臭」，當酸產生的時候，開始腐敗，產生臭味，惡性物質和毒素會不斷地滋長，這個我們平常都可以看得見。即使是一般的水份不動，就會酸臭因此毒素會影響到身體，危及身體的健康。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(倪師曾說若身體能充滿熱氣，沒有ㄧ處有冷水淤積，身體是不會有癌症的)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-wk5t1y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-wk5t1y7","updated":"20240522103649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題7，那身體是很「酸」，又沒有癌細胞來清理，最後會怎樣？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：毒素大量流入血液，短短一天內，就可能會死亡，所以請建立一個觀念，癌細胞既然是您的細胞，不是什麼「壞小孩」的理論，這不是一個正確的觀念，等毒素處理完，它就會自然代謝死亡。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-wlexli5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-wlexli5","updated":"20240522103652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題8，所以我們應該感謝癌細胞？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答案：嗯，不需要像是有人說「慈悲」和「愛」、「包容」等等來對待癌細胞，這樣的說法很奇怪的，這是錯認以為癌細胞是壞的細胞的態度，這是身體自然的運作，跟您感謝不感謝，沒有什麼關係。就好像您每天大小便排泄，對於健康很有幫助，但您不會刻意去感謝「大小便排泄」，是一樣的道理。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-m06svpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-m06svpo","updated":"20240522103654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題9，那癌細胞如果形成腫瘤，那會怎樣？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：身體的正常細胞會和癌細胞一起工作，來產生腫瘤，這是因為這地方可能是最酸性的地區，惡性物質和毒素不斷蔓延的區域。因此腫瘤本身不是壞事，這是代表您的身體有在處理這區域，協助您改善身體。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-tk3dael","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-tk3dael","updated":"20240522103655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題10，如果癌症不去治療，會怎樣？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：男性的攝護腺癌經過解剖後，33％都有，卻只有1％的人因此而死亡。自然衰老死亡屍體的解剖顯示，甲狀腺癌、胰臟癌也是醫生檢查出來的三十至四十倍。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-5zhkfm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-5zhkfm7","updated":"20240522103701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題11，難道現代的醫療不好嗎？像是化療？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：一個由澳洲北雪梨癌症中心放射腫瘤科所做的調查，研究在二十二個主要的成人惡性腫瘤中，化療後五年存活率的效果」，「在澳洲估計是百分之2.3，在美國則是百分之2.1 」。所以不要治療，都不一定會比較差。您需要為了這樣的中獎機率，去作化學治療嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＊您是50個人中的幸運的那個人嗎？＊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-x3zozii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-x3zozii","updated":"20240522103704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題12，真的不要治療，不會怎樣嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：這本書告訴您：「甚至，完全不治療癌症還比接受治療擁有更高的成功率。」癌症所引起的現代化的西醫的醫療行為，包括開刀，化學治療、放射性治療，可能產生的傷害，非常的大。甚至是病人致死的主因！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＊我覺得當然要開始治療，但不是開刀、化療、放療等的治療，是要先改變心情，紓解壓力，潔淨飲食！＊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-a7tuyzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-a7tuyzn","updated":"20240522103707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題13：那要請教「開刀」治療，這樣不好嗎？將毒素也一起拿掉，為何不好？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：癌細胞就像是一群水肥工人，他們每天蒐集水肥，最後將水肥車放在某個地方，他們也在那裡休息，雖然他們的身體又髒又臭，但這不是他們的錯！是這個都市變得又髒又亂，所以需要他們來清理！癌症也是如此。問題並不在於癌細胞本身，如果沒有都市的髒亂，這些身體的毒素，就不會有水肥工人，清潔人員，他們來吸取這些毒素，放進水肥車，形成腫瘤裡面的垃圾，最後他們用盡方法慢慢地消化這些毒素。所以他們是整個都市能夠繼續運作的大功臣。如果今天將腫瘤拿掉，身體酸性的問題還是存在，並沒有獲得減緩。癌症還是會復發，因為身體偏酸的問題一直存在。本來會集中到這腫瘤區域，但現在水肥工人和水肥車都被清理掉了，以後的垃圾和毒素如何處理呢？現代西學的醫療過於暴力，許多人無法從開刀中恢復。正常人都不會喜歡有人讓我們開腸破肚，這樣的風險太大！而且隨後的放射性、化學更是恐怖的醫療，通殺各細胞，這已經是無知的醫療！完全不知道真正會致命的是毒素，不是癌細胞！所以根本的問題不是在於開不開刀，是說，這個人的生活出了什麼問題？這些問題，病患有沒有察覺？如果沒有察覺，能夠繼續快樂生活，情緒穩定也還好，癌細胞還是繼續運作處理毒素，一直到生命的終了。如果一定要破壞腫瘤，那就要問，這個人的身體的種種問題不會因為這樣而紓解，大部分的人開刀以後，更辛苦。後果更難以承受。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如此光是切片就會把腫瘤裡面的垃圾引流出來，毒素流掉了癌細胞就會去追它，表面上看到的是腫瘤轉移，其時是毒素的擴散，而把毒素抓回原本的腫瘤中是癌細胞的任務，西醫觀察到稱為腫瘤自播（self-seeding），所以臨床上有觀察到腫瘤有領域性，如倪師有ㄧ案例腎癌，它的任務便是吸收血液中的毒素，等ㄧ段時間腫大後便由尿中排出髒血如此便又自動縮小，身上便不會有其他腫瘤產生，所以癌細胞是好是壞，端看自己如何解讀，存著感恩的心而不是恐懼和怨恨則肯定疾病已好了許多！)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-jhg1ghl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-jhg1ghl","updated":"20240522103709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題14：開刀等等的治療總有治癒的成功比率吧？那是多少？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：一個統計的數據，以五年存活率來說，是7％，您覺得高還是低？不去治療，都不一定會死，生活品質也不會降低。除非腫瘤過大，產生身體的阻礙，可是即使是如此，病患應該趕快改變身體的生活起居的種種習慣：晚上早點休息，潔淨飲食，平常靜坐，放輕鬆，不要對人嗔怒，慢慢接觸大自然，想些快樂的事情，這樣才是養生之道。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-o5reig3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-o5reig3","updated":"20240522103713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問題15：有不去治療，會好轉的例子嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"答：英國曾經有人被西醫宣告回家吃自己，數日子等死，剛好他的另外一半也是頑固的慢性病，兩個人意想天開，把若干家產處理以後，便快樂地環遊世界了。結果過了一年，因為一直還不死，這樣令當事者也很困擾，只好再去檢查。結果是腫瘤已經消失了。因為他旅遊時的心情太好了！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＊所以心情不要被恐嚇，被您的主治醫師恐嚇，那就沒有救了。＊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因為如果您任他擺佈，您活著的機率只有7％，而且還沒有離開人間之前，接下來的生活品質非常低劣，而且連累整個家庭進入悲雲慘霧之中。而且有一件事情，您應該要知道，醫療人員的壽命比較短。而且外科手術者，可能壽命更短。您需要聽從壽命比您還短的人的建議嗎？您需要聽從治癒您的機率很低，大部分都是將人治死的人的建議嗎？全世界沒有一位西醫願意保證您的健康，永遠跟您說機率。您的生死，您希望訴諸於一個不確定的機率？還是您想有智慧地去面對？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-ou5gfi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-ou5gfi2","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這是對癌症的另類思惟，不過若有人依照這樣的思路治療好癌症，而且痊癒率比西醫的機率還高，是否又證明西醫學的癌症理論架構是有問題的，此點值得眾人深思！"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-wwp9hvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-wwp9hvq","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"弟子 趙醫師 敬書"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-agmjd7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-agmjd7f","updated":"20240522103507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"趙醫師寫的真好，真是好，趙醫師的治病與觀察功力已經臻於巔峰，真棒啊。經方之學有此傳人，我相信仲景醫聖必然開懷大笑。說真話，只陳述真實案例發生過程，是我輩醫師的天職所在，當一位優秀醫師的先決態度就是要誠實，誠可以入人心。說出真實案例不造假，唯一的目的就是希望能救到可以不必死的人。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-up1bd70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-up1bd70","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  趙醫師所提到老師的腎臟癌病患，就是老師現在在美國幫老師作帳所聘僱的會計師的夫人，她於2000年時被本地醫師宣判只能再活半年，經過老師的治療後至今仍然存活著。"}]},{"ID":"20240522103015-wzjiyb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103015-wzjiyb7","updated":"20240522103015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年01月03日"}]},{"ID":"20240522103719-u9rhea8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522103719-u9rhea8"}},{"ID":"20240522103721-p89p0oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522103721-p89p0oz"}}]}